  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>마<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>마<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>과<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>칠<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xeCxCXaNvFA?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>問<rt>믕ˉ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    láng na-mn̄g~ lì kâh-goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>兩人<rt>능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>啥<rt>샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>關係<rt>관ˉ헤ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    nng-láng tàu-toè siâ̰-koān-hē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>介紹<rt>개ˋᄉᆤ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>小妹<rt>쇼ˆ뻬ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kài-siau-lì~ si-goâ-siô-bē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>坦白<rt>탄ˆ벻ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kâ̰-kông-thân-pêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雖然<rt>쉬ˉ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>一直<rt>읻ˆ딛-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗崁<rt>암ˋ캄</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sūi-rien-sī~ ît-tit-àm-kham\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>真<rt>진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>難過<rt>란궤</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīm-lāi kâm-kâk-jīn-lan-kue\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌壇<rt>과ˉ돨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    īn-wi-goà tiàm-jai-koā-toá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>最<rt>줴ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>需要<rt>수ˉᄋᆤ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌迷<rt>과ˉ뻬ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    juè-sū-yau si-koā-bé\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˆ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>女兒<rt>루ˆ띠ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    láng na-jâi~ goà u-lû-rí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>歲頭<rt>훼ˋᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    huè-tháu yu-jiâh-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>恐驚<rt>켱ˆ걀ˆ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>可比<rt>코ˆ비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>秋天<rt>츄ˉ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>落花<rt>락ˆ훼ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khiông-kiâ̰~ khô-pî-chiū-thḭ̂’e lâk-huê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>名聲<rt>먀샬ˆ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>飄飄<rt>ᄑᆤˉᄑᆤˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>墜落<rt>뒤롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>地<rt>되ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mia-siâ̰~ phiāu-phiāu-tui-loh-toē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>環境<rt>환곙ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>造成<rt>조솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>聊<rt>ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>命運<rt>먀운ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ît-che sī~ hoan-kièng lai-jo-sieng-bo-liáu’e mia-ūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>滿面<rt>뫄ˆ삔ˉ</rt></ruby>’에~ <ruby>胭脂水粉<rt>옌ˉ지ˉ쥐ˆ훈ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    moâ-bīn’e~ yēn-jī-jûi-hùn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>打扮<rt>달ˆ반ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>當<rt>등ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tâ̰-pān tn̄g-chiēng-chûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>上<rt>쥴-</rt></ruby><ruby>舞台<rt>뿌ˆ대ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>表演<rt>ᄇᆤˆ옌ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌唱<rt>과ˉ츌</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiṵ-bû-tái piâu-yên-koā-chiṵ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>引<rt>인ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>迷魂<rt>뻬훈ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>笑文文<rt>쵸ˋ뿐뿐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    în-láng be-hún chiò-bun-bún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌壇<rt>과ˉ돨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    īn-wi-goà tiàm-jai-koā-toá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>靠<rt>코ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>藝術<rt>께숟-</rt></ruby><ruby>趁<rt>탄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>錢銀<rt>질꾼ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khò-ge-sut-thàn-jḭ-gún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>母囝<rt>뿌ˆ걀ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>相依為命<rt>셩ˉ이ˉ위뼹ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bû-kià̰ lai-siōng-ī-wi-biēng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>勞苦<rt>로커ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>議論<rt>끼룬ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lo-khòr bo-gi-lūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>通<rt>탕ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>怨嘆<rt>완ˋ탄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>情<rt>졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>郎君<rt>렁군ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    nà thāng-oàn-thàn-bo-jiéng’e long-kûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>每日<rt>뮈ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>亂紛紛<rt>롼훈훈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mûi-rît sīm-koâ̰ loan-hun-hūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>興趣<rt>혱ˋ추</rt></ruby>’둏~ <ruby>唱歌<rt>츌ˋ과ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一<rt>짇-</rt></ruby><ruby>唱<rt>츌</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>十<rt>잡-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby>冬<rt>당ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hièng-chu’tioh~ chiṵ̀-koā-lái jit-chiṵ î-kiēng-jap-roa-tâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親<rt>친ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>手<rt>츄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래ˊ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>晟養<rt>챨영ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>女兒<rt>루ˆ띠ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiù lái~ chia̰-yông-lû-rí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>願<rt>꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby>靠<rt>코ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>別人<rt>받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-goan-khò-pat-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>薄情郎<rt>봏졩렁ˊ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>離開<rt>리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>了後<rt>ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    poh-jieng-lóng~ li-khûi liâu-āu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>全<rt>좐-</rt></ruby><ruby>放<rt>방</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiōng-tioh-ài-jiéng lông-joan-pang\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>因為<rt>인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>歌壇<rt>과ˉ돨ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    īn-wi-goà tiàm-jai-koā-toá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>能力<rt>롕롁ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>再<rt>재ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>活動<rt>왛당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-lieng-liêk jài-oah-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>期待<rt>기태ˉ</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레-</rt></ruby><ruby>前程<rt>졘뎽ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ki-thāi’tio bî-le-jien-tiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>相信<rt>셩ˉ신ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>好夢<rt>호ˆ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siōng-sìn-u-hô-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>用心<rt>영심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>栽培<rt>재ˉ붸-</rt></ruby><ruby>女兒<rt>루ˆ띠-</rt></ruby><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>清芳<rt>촁ˉ팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yong-sîm jāi-pue-lû-ri-huê chiēng-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>一生<rt>읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>願望<rt>꽌빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-goâ-ît-siêng’e goan-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
}
